1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,770
(Leonard:)This is going to decide who's
the hero and who's the sidekick?

2
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,020
(Howard:)You got a better idea?

3
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:18,450
(Leonard:)Every idea is better
than this idea.

4
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,650
(Howard:)Ding!

5
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,490
Wait. What the hell is "ding"?
It's a bell.

6
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:24,090
(Raj:)I don't think this
kind of wrestling has a bell.

7
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,930
(Howard:)Fine. How do you
want to start?

8
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:28,060
(Raj:)I say, uh, how about
one, two, three, go?

9
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,700
(Howard:)One-two-three-go?
That's for babies.

10
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,730
(Raj:)Okay, how about, uh...

11
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,170
(Raj:)On your mark, get set, go?

12
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,520
(Howard:)That's for a footrace.
If you want to race,

13
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,840
(Howard:)we have to go outside.

14
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,640
(Raj:)No, it's chilly outside.
Didn't bring my jacket.

15
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:42,360
(Howard:)Oh, for crying out loud.

16
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,680
(Howard:)What kind of superhero
needs a jacket?

17
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,070
(Raj:)What kind of superhero says,
"Dibs on the red tights!

18
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,780
Dibs on the red tights!"

19
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:51,750
(Howard:)All right, how about this?
Ready, wrestle.

20
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:54,360
(Raj:)Wait. Are we starting now? Or
is that what you're going to say

21
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,660
(Raj:)when we do start, or...
We're starting now!

22
00:00:55,660 --> 00:01:05,020
(Raj:)Don't yell at me!

